id: PACK31-2
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: vocab_declaration
target: crates/pack/src/vocab_check.rs
find:                         .any(|o| o.get("label").is_some_and(|l| !l.is_null()))
replace:                         .any(|o| o.get("label").is_some_and(|l| l.is_null()))
expect-fail: pack31_label_with_vocab_below_1_3_is_reported
note: 確認の選択肢の label を使用と数える判定を反転させる（label を使う教材が通る）
